// @description RS Trig Sampler - 8-slot multi-velocity / round-robin drum sampler (Trigger-style)
// @author Todoroki
// @version 1.4
// @changelog
//   - VELOCITY target per slot: play a fixed velocity (VEL SENS 0%) or follow the drummer's
//     dynamics around it (VEL SENS 100%), clipped to 127
//   - Clicking an empty slot opens the browser directly
//   - Folder browser (Element / Instrument / mic), search across the whole library, >4000 files
//   - English UI
//   - Time-based drum envelope (attack / hold / decay / curve), anti-click fades, voice limit
// @about
//   # RS Trig Sampler
//
//   Drum replacement sampler in JSFX (portable REAPER friendly), meant to sit after a trigger
//   (MIDI) tool. One instance = one drum element, up to 8 samples played in parallel.
//
//   - 8 slots, each with multi-velocity / round-robin kits (.rsk.wav) or plain audio files
//   - Per slot: volume, pan, pitch, attack / hold / decay / curve, velocity target + sensitivity,
//     voices, round robin cycle / random, choke groups, 8 stereo outputs, mute / solo
//   - Samples are stored in the project and in REAPER presets (one preset = a full layered kit)
//   - Library in `<REAPER>/Data/RSampler`, filled by the **RS Trig Kit Builder** script
//     (Slate Trigger 2 .tci import, WAV folders, auto-organised by element / instrument)
desc:RS Trig Sampler - 8-slot multi-velocity / round-robin drum sampler
tags:instrument sampler drum trigger multi-velocity round-robin
in_pin:none
out_pin:Out 1/2 L
out_pin:Out 1/2 R
out_pin:Out 3/4 L
out_pin:Out 3/4 R
out_pin:Out 5/6 L
out_pin:Out 5/6 R
out_pin:Out 7/8 L
out_pin:Out 7/8 R
out_pin:Out 9/10 L
out_pin:Out 9/10 R
out_pin:Out 11/12 L
out_pin:Out 11/12 R
out_pin:Out 13/14 L
out_pin:Out 13/14 R
out_pin:Out 15/16 L
out_pin:Out 15/16 R
